@startuml diagrama-pacotes
skinparam packageStyle rect

package "aluguelcarros" {

  package "controller" as controller {
  }

  package "service" as service {
  }

  package "model" as model {
  }

  package "repository" as repository {
  }

  package "view (templates/static)" as view {
  }

}

note right of controller: Intercepta requisições HTTP e gerencia o fluxo de telas
note right of service: Regras de negócio, validações de limites e contratos
note right of model: Entidades de domínio (Cliente, Pedido, Automovel, etc.)
note right of repository: Camada de persistência de dados
note right of view: Interface gráfica (HTML5/CSS3)

view ..> controller : envia formulários
controller ..> service : delega regras
controller ..> model : manipula dados
service ..> repository : persiste/busca
service ..> model : valida entidades
repository ..> model : lê/grava

@enduml